From da1b9f52ce7825dd9c55425281b1d67fd13944b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Martin <dnmard@amazon.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 23:53:41 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Adds OpenGL ES 3.2 & Wayland support - This improves
 compatibility across Linux platforms - Allows lower-end Arm devices to use
 Supermodel - Avoids using restricted OpenGL drivers and XWayland - Fix
 initial rendering, especially when set to Fullscreen. - Add Render Scale
 option for lower-end devices with the New3D engine only

